fo":{"genres":["Biography","Drama"],"id":562,"type":"MOVIE","title":"You Don't Know Jack","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk50/shows/599c7bfe-56e0-4af2-9f75-2bbf5e98e34b.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk47/shows/9dae89d7-c579-49e1-98ac-b626f6ed4ad2.jpg","likes":25,"dislikes":0,"views":4614,"release_date":"1272067200000","length":8068,"description":"Dr. Jack Kevorkian (1928 - 2011 ) in the 1990s, when he defies Michigan law assisting the suicide of terminally-ill persons. Support comes from his sister, a lab tech, the Hemlock Society president, and a lawyer. The child of survivors of the Armenian genocide interviews applicants: his sister video tapes them. He assembles a device allowing a person to initiate a three-chemical intravenous drip. The local D.A., the governor, and the Legislature respond. In court scenes, Kevorkian is sometimes antic. He's single-minded about giving dying individuals the right to determine how their lives will end. He wants the Supreme Court to rule. He picks a fight he can't win: is it hubris or heroism?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.6}],"value":7.6,"age":"R"},"episode_id":562,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}